llads (and Other Deadly Songs)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FtGJHhqXcDI"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This album marked a significant success for Sonic Youth, catapulting them out of underground circles. While the speaker notes it's a \"master album\" with \"epic moments,\" they also express that it might not be substantially better than earlier works like *Confusion Is Sex* or *Sister*. Its success led to two major changes: the band gained greater cachet, allowing them to live comfortably from their music, and they signed with Geffen Records. \"Redding Nation es el éxito que los catapulta y los saca un poco de esos círculos underground.\"","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"SONIC YOUTH: Guitarras al límite","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=718mYxplXJE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This double album was released in 1988 after the band moved to the indie label Enigma, and is considered their best indie moment. \"Sonic Youth's best indie moment probably came in 1988 when they moved to another indie label called Enigma and released a double set called Daydream Nation.\"","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The History of Indie Rock: Part 3","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCtQqVBtCaI"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Breakthrough Album","body":"This album marked a significant success for Sonic Youth, catapulting them out of underground circles. While the speaker notes it's a \"master album\" with \"epic moments,\" they also express that it might not be substantially better than earlier works like *Confusion Is Sex* or *Sister*. Its success led to two major changes: the band gained greater cachet, allowing them to live comfortably from their music, and they signed with Geffen Records. \"Redding Nation es el éxito que los catapulta y los saca un poco de esos círculos underground.\"","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"SONIC YOUTH: Guitarras al límite","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=718mYxplXJE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Critically Acclaimed Album","body":"Released in 1988, \"Daydream Nation\" topped various readers' polls, cementing Sonic Youth's reputation as a highly respected indie band. Its success attracted the attention of major labels, who hoped to replicate R.E.M.'s successful transition to a larger label. \"And when their daydream nation album topped all kinds of Readers' polls in 1988, a lot of major labels thought they could do with Sonic Youth what Warner's did with R.E.M.\"","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"From the Archives: The Top 100 Moments in New Rock - Part 8","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AymMybE33zU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Double Set on Enigma","body":"This double album was released in 1988 after the band moved to the indie label Enigma, and is considered their best indie moment. \"Sonic Youth's best indie moment probably came in 1988 when they moved to another indie label called Enigma and released a double set called Daydream Nation.\"","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The History of Indie Rock: Part 3","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCtQqVBtCaI"}]}],"book_tracks":[{"id":53763307282316,"artist":"Sonic Youth","artist_id":219526641934913,"title":"Daydream Nation","year":1988,"ess":1,"yt":"PVwJMOtfJbU","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Minimal-rock: Sonic Youth y Swans","scene_id":179922132646505,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#minimal-rock","chapters":["Sección 5.13"],"pages":[[1,166,null]]},{"id":53763307282316,"artist":"Sonic Youth","artist_id":219526641934913,"title":"Daydream Nation","year":null,"ess":0,"yt":"PVwJMOtfJbU","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title